    "description": "Compiles scene lore fragments and physical asset specifications into cohesive, world-anchored diffusion prompts for Black Forest Labs Flux 3 Klein. On asset selection, the Fragment Compiler resolves world materials, physical bounding volume, mass, and doctrine rules. The Prompt Rewriter refines the compiled brief into an isolated 2.5D orthographic game asset prompt, which is then dispatched to the ComfyUI asset forge.",
